#. ja: マジックプリズム:ジョブマスター
#. de: Holo-Prisma[p] „Jobmeisterschaft“
#. fr: prisme magique<nbsp>: maître de job
#. column 2: magicked prisms (job mastery)
#. column 8: This peculiar contraption creates illusions by weaving together myriad shades of light. Produces a halo of stars to indicate that you are the very model of a modern major job master.
#. column 9: Magicked Prism (Job Mastery)
msgctxt "Item:25005:0:0"
msgid "magicked prism (job mastery)"
msgstr "магический призма (мастерство профессии)"

#. de: Holo-Prismen[p] „Jobmeisterschaft“
#. fr: prismes magiques<nbsp>: maître de job
#. column 0: magicked prism (job mastery)
#. column 8: This peculiar contraption creates illusions by weaving together myriad shades of light. Produces a halo of stars to indicate that you are the very model of a modern major job master.
#. column 9: Magicked Prism (Job Mastery)
msgctxt "Item:25005:0:2"
msgid "magicked prisms (job mastery)"
msgstr "магические призмы (мастерство профессии)"

#. ja: 魔法の光で幻影を映し出す小結晶。ジョブを極めた気分になれる
#. de: Dieser kleine Kristall lässt wie von magischer Hand eine holographische Projektion drei goldener Sterne erscheinen.
#. fr: Ce petit cristal projette des images grâce à une lumière magique. Il donne l'impression d'exceller dans son domaine.
#. column 0: magicked prism (job mastery)
#. column 2: magicked prisms (job mastery)
#. column 9: Magicked Prism (Job Mastery)
msgctxt "Item:25005:0:8"
msgid "This peculiar contraption creates illusions by weaving together myriad shades of light. Produces a halo of stars to indicate that you are the very model of a modern major job master."
msgstr "Эта необычная безделушка сплетает из множества оттенков света иллюзии. Создаёт над головой звёздный ореол, достойный того, кто в совершенстве освоил свою профессию."

#. ja: マジックプリズム:ジョブマスター
#. de: Holo-Prisma „Jobmeisterschaft“
#. fr: Prisme magique<nbsp>: maître de job
#. column 0: magicked prism (job mastery)
#. column 2: magicked prisms (job mastery)
#. column 8: This peculiar contraption creates illusions by weaving together myriad shades of light. Produces a halo of stars to indicate that you are the very model of a modern major job master.
msgctxt "Item:25005:0:9"
msgid "Magicked Prism (Job Mastery)"
msgstr "Магическая призма (мастерство профессии)"

